          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወቱ ፡ እስመ ፡ ስብሐ ፡ ለሰብእ ፡ ይዌስኮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃይለ ፡ እንዲል ፡ እንዘ ፡ ጽኑዓን ፡ አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትሙ ፡ አለ ፡ ሮሜ ፡ ፲፭ ፥ ፲፬ ፥ ፲፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
